hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"52","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) 'unhen bosa dete the jabke Aap rozedar hote.'"
"53","[AI-translation] Shaikh [Abul Husain Al-Hafiz] ne kaha: Aur Abdullah bin Sulaiman bin Ash'as ne hamen bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Ruzaiq ne hamen bayan kiya, Waleed ne hamen bayan kiya, Auza'i ne hamen bayan kiya, Yahya bin Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se, Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se, Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unhen bosa dete the jabke Aap rozedar hote."
"54","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) 'unhen bosa dete the jabke Aap rozedar hote.'"
"55","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ne Abu Salamah ko khabar di ke Urwah ne unhen khabar di ke Aishah ne unhen khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) 'unhen bosa dete the jabke Aap rozedar hote.'"
"56","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah se, jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja hain, unhon ne kaha: 'Namaz [shuru mein] do rakat thi, muqeem hone mein bhi aur safar mein bhi. Phir safar ki namaz do rakat par baqi rakhi gayi, aur muqeem hone ki namaz chaar [rakat] poori kar di gayi.' [Rawi ne] kaha: To main ne use Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ko khabar di, phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Urwah ne mujhe khabar di hai ke Aishah safar mein chaar rakat padhti thin. Phir ek din main ne Urwah ko Umar bin Abdul Aziz ke paas paya, to main ne kaha: Tum ne mujhe Aishah ke bare mein kya khabar di thi? To unhon ne waise hi bayan kiya jaisa unhon ne mujhe [pehle] bayan kiya tha. To Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne un se kaha: Tum ne mujhe khabar di thi ke wo safar mein chaar [rakat] padhti thin. Unhon ne kaha: Ji han."
"57","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se — aur [is ke sath] Ibn Abi Habibah se, Dawud bin Husain se, Urwah se, Aishah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) 'raat ko namaz padhte the jabke main Aap ke samne bistar par aade leti hoti.' Ibn Abi Habibah ne kaha: Aur Ibn Khalid ne apni hadees mein izafa kiya: '[Aade leti] jaise janaza aada leta hai; phir jab Aap witr padhne ka irada farmate to mujhe jagate phir main bhi witr padhti.'"
"58","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek mard ke bare mein poocha gaya jo apni biwi se jima kare magar mani kharij na ho. Aap ne farmaya: 'Wo namaz ke wuzu ki tarah wuzu kare, aur apni sharmgah dhoe.'"
"59","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Jibreel (Alaihissalam) Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye jab suraj dhal gaya aur jhuk gaya, phir kaha: 'Khade hon, phir Aap ne zuhr chaar [rakat] padhi. Phir wo Aap ke paas aaye jab har cheez ka saya us [cheez] ke barabar ho gaya, phir kaha: Khade hon, phir Aap ne asr chaar [rakat] padhi. Phir wo Aap ke paas aaye jab suraj ghuroob ho gaya, phir kaha: Khade hon, phir Aap ne maghrib padhi. Phir wo Aap ke paas aaye jab shafaq [surkhi] ghayab ho gayi, phir kaha: Khade hon, phir Aap ne isha aakhirah chaar [rakat] padhi. Phir wo Aap ke paas aaye jab fajr roshan ho gayi aur wazeh ho gayi, phir kaha: Khade hon, phir Aap ne subah do rakat padhi. Phir agle din wo zuhr ki namaz ke liye aaye jab har cheez ka saya us ke barabar ho gaya, phir Aap ne zuhr chaar [rakat] padhi. Phir wo aaye jab har cheez ka saya dugna ho gaya, phir Aap ne asr chaar [rakat] padhi. Phir wo pehle waqt [ki tarah] aaye jab suraj ghuroob ho gaya, phir Aap ne maghrib padhi. Phir wo aaye jab shafaq ghayab ho gayi aur andhera chha gaya, phir Aap ne isha aakhirah padhi. Phir wo aaye jab fajr roshan ho gayi aur wazeh ho gayi, phir Aap ne subah do rakat padhi. Phir Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasul, [namazon ka waqt] in dono ke darmiyan hai' — murad waqt [namaz] hai."
"60","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai: [Unhon ne] yehi hadees bilkul isi tarah [khbar di], siwae is ke ke unhon ne apni hadees mein kaha: Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ne kaha: 'Ye tumhari namaz hai aur tum se pehle ambiya ki namaz hai.'"
"61","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm se — aur wo Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ke qazi [hakim] the — unhon ne kaha: Urwah bin Zubair ne Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) ko Abu Mas'ud Ansari aur Basheer bin Abu Mas'ud se bayan kiya — aur dono Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi the — ke Jibreel Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye. Aur [rawi ne] isi ki manind, ya is se milti julti, ya is jaisi hadees zikr ki."
